# A long flythrough under ray tracing (reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/step-default.md, «Приёмка»):
# the route of streaming-flythrough, market -> harbour -> forest and back, ten laps at 10 m/s, so chunks and their
# landscape BLAS come and go many times. Each lap ends in the market after the streaming settles with a `mark lap-N`;
# the process's video memory (nvidia-smi) and the `render: rt landscape` / `render: rt scene` lines of game.log at the
# marks are compared with lap 1. Run it under the default:
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh rt-default-soak
# @timeout 3600
seed 73030
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 700 280 180
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
wait 10000
streaming wait
mark lap-0
route 1000 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04 NW_CITY_HABOUR_BENCH_01 NW_FOREST_PATH_16
streaming wait
route 1000 NW_FOREST_PATH_16 NW_CITY_HABOUR_BENCH_01 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
streaming wait
wait 5000
mark lap-1
route 1000 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04 NW_CITY_HABOUR_BENCH_01 NW_FOREST_PATH_16
streaming wait
route 1000 NW_FOREST_PATH_16 NW_CITY_HABOUR_BENCH_01 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
streaming wait
wait 5000
mark lap-2
route 1000 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04 NW_CITY_HABOUR_BENCH_01 NW_FOREST_PATH_16
streaming wait
route 1000 NW_FOREST_PATH_16 NW_CITY_HABOUR_BENCH_01 NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
streaming wait
wait 5000
